- decided_at: 2026-09-23T03:56:33+00:00
  event: initial
  value: Right-hand TUI column lists files changed by agent write/edit/patch tools this session, tallied in memory from tool args; shown only when frame >= 100 cols
  reason: No git or disk polling needed and works outside git repos; hidden on narrow terminals to keep the transcript readable; shell-mode edits are not tracked
- decided_at: 2026-10-07T04:23:27+00:00
  event: superseded-previous
  value: Session sidebar appears at reserved frame width >=120, hides on home, toggles with /sidebar or Ctrl+X b; retain git watcher, file/diff click actions, context, agent and process metadata.
  reason: Match OpenCode responsive session layout without losing fastllm operational details.
